<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.6">
<l>eruttuk koṭiyuṭai yāṉum pirama ṉumin tiraṉumaṟṟum</l>
<l>oruttaru mippiṟa viyeṉṉum nōykku maruntaṟi vārumillai</l>
<l>maruttuva ṉāyniṉṟa māmaṇi vaṇṇā maṟupiṟa vitavirat</l>
<l>tiruttiyuṅ kōyiṟ kaṭaippukap peytiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>He with the bull banner, Brahmā, Indra and all the others</l>
<l>do not know the cure for the disease called ‘this birth’.</l>
<l>Great Jewel Hued One who stands as the physician,</l>
<l rend="indent">mending in order to prevent any more births,</l>
<l>make it so that [I] reach the entrance of your temple.</l>
<l rend="indent">my Father in Tirumāliruñcōlai.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
